const extraSilverGuides={"mind":["Mindbreaker","c3",[475,157,345,169,492,370,320,358,324],[5,3,4,3,5,4,4,4,4],["Short opening par 5 doglegs right with bunkers left. A well-placed drive gives a chance to reach in two.","All-carry tee shot over water; short shots roll back toward water or a deep bunker. Aim center, especially to a front pin.","Semi-blind drive between three fairway bunkers. Angled green guarded by a large front bunker.","Take extra club to clear the front pot bunker; mounds behind the green can return a long shot.","Open par 5 rewards an aggressive drive, but bunkers guard the green and approaches must carry.","Plays longer because of the elevated green. Aim right off the tee and take extra club approaching.","Use the left-to-right slope on this dogleg right. Undulating green guarded by pot bunkers and a left bunker.","Leave driver in the bag; fairway slopes toward a creek on the right. Approach must carry the creek.","Uphill finishing par 4. Favor the left fairway bunker area for the approach angle; heavily bunkered green."]],"heart":["Heartbreaker","c2",[481,375,381,357,152,343,479,146,353],[5,4,4,4,3,4,5,3,4],["Uphill opening par 5 with two large fairway bunkers and deep pot bunkers short of the narrow green.","Dogleg left around a fairway bunker. Slightly elevated green has front bunkers; take extra club.","Carry the left fairway bunker for a good approach angle. Favor center of the green between left bunker and right hills.","Aim tee shot toward the right fairway bunker for the best angle; a cavernous bunker protects the green.","Hit high and soft to the elevated green. A deep front bunker punishes shots left short.","Left fairway bunker pinches landing area. Undulating green rewards a close approach to avoid three-putts.","Downhill par 5 plays shorter. Avoid two ponds left and carry another on second shot. Elevated green guarded short and right.","All-carry tee shot over water. Green is 43 yards deep; club for the pin and avoid bunkers on both sides.","Dogleg left; play to the widest fairway. The green juts into the lake and demands a precise approach."]],"short":["Short Course","c4",[123,133,146,156,150,138,111,116,153],[3,3,3,3,3,3,3,3,3],["Forced carry over lake to an elevated green, with a bunker guarding long.","Short but challenging; a pot bunker cuts into the hillside of the elevated green.","All-carry over water and deep bunker. Find the right section of the severely undulating green.","Tough peninsula green with a bunker in front catching shots left short.","Uphill tee shot to a large elevated green without a major water carry; good birdie opportunity.","Elevated tee makes this long par 3 play shorter. Pond and waterfall guard the wide green.","Shortest hole; angled green has large undulations. Aim at the pin for birdie.","Peninsula green juts into lake, but the absence of bunkers makes it approachable.","Final carry over lake to slightly elevated peninsula green; bunker long and right."]]};
